IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `bsma-types`
IMPORT `bsma-meetings`
IMPORT `bsma-developer`
IMPORT `bsma-corporation`
IMPORT `bsma-council`
IMPORT `bsma-boards-offences`
IMPORT `bsma-goal`

-- Independent tests for the BSMA 2004 encoding. Every expected value comes
-- from independent-expectations.md, written from the source before any .l4
-- file was read. Each assertion carries its E-number. Expected values were
-- NOT changed after reading the encoding.

§ `Independent tests`

§§ `Helpers (inputs only, no rules)`

GIVEN d IS A NUMBER, f IS A NUMBER, a IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A Motion
`hands, day` d `, for` f `, against` a MEANS
    Motion WITH
        `a duly convened general meeting`                   IS TRUE
        `days from notice to meeting`                       IS d
        `a poll taken`                                      IS FALSE
        `valid votes for`                                   IS f
        `valid votes against`                               IS a
        `share value of lots with valid votes for`          IS f
        `share value of lots with valid votes against`      IS a
        `weeks since the meeting`                           IS 0
        `share value voting for, at the end of 12 weeks`    IS 0
        `aggregate share value of all subsidiary proprietors, at the end of 12 weeks` IS 0
        `every subsidiary proprietor supports it in writing, at the end of 12 weeks` IS FALSE

GIVEN d IS A NUMBER, hf IS A NUMBER, ha IS A NUMBER, sf IS A NUMBER, sa IS A NUMBER, p IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A Motion
`votes, day` d `, hands` hf `:` ha `, share value` sf `:` sa `, poll:` p MEANS
    Motion WITH
        `a duly convened general meeting`                   IS TRUE
        `days from notice to meeting`                       IS d
        `a poll taken`                                      IS p
        `valid votes for`                                   IS hf
        `valid votes against`                               IS ha
        `share value of lots with valid votes for`          IS sf
        `share value of lots with valid votes against`      IS sa
        `weeks since the meeting`                           IS 0
        `share value voting for, at the end of 12 weeks`    IS 0
        `aggregate share value of all subsidiary proprietors, at the end of 12 weeks` IS 0
        `every subsidiary proprietor supports it in writing, at the end of 12 weeks` IS FALSE

GIVEN d IS A NUMBER, w IS A NUMBER, sf IS A NUMBER, agg IS A NUMBER, everyone IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A Motion
`twelve-week motion, day` d `, weeks` w `, for` sf `of` agg `, everyone in writing:` everyone MEANS
    Motion WITH
        `a duly convened general meeting`                   IS TRUE
        `days from notice to meeting`                       IS d
        `a poll taken`                                      IS TRUE
        `valid votes for`                                   IS 0
        `valid votes against`                               IS 0
        `share value of lots with valid votes for`          IS 0
        `share value of lots with valid votes against`      IS 0
        `weeks since the meeting`                           IS w
        `share value voting for, at the end of 12 weeks`    IS sf
        `aggregate share value of all subsidiary proprietors, at the end of 12 weeks` IS agg
        `every subsidiary proprietor supports it in writing, at the end of 12 weeks` IS everyone

GIVEN age IS A NUMBER, cap IS A `Candidate capacity`, arrears IS A BOOLEAN, bankrupt IS A BOOLEAN, declared IS A BOOLEAN, elected IS A BOOLEAN, office IS A `Council office`, terms IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A Candidate
`candidate aged` age `as` cap `, arrears:` arrears `, bankrupt:` bankrupt `, declared:` declared `, already elected:` elected `, for` office `, treasurer terms` terms MEANS
    Candidate WITH
        `age`                                               IS age
        `capacity`                                          IS cap
        `arrears on the lot 3 days before the election`     IS arrears
        `a joint proprietor whose co-proprietor also stands or nominates` IS FALSE
        `the nominator's nominees exceed its threshold number` IS FALSE
        `an undischarged bankrupt`                          IS bankrupt
        `bankruptcy declared in writing at nomination`      IS declared
        `already elected to another of chairperson, secretary, treasurer` IS elected
        `standing for`                                      IS office
        `consecutive terms already served as treasurer`     IS terms

GIVEN due IS A DATE, paid IS A MAYBE DATE, demand IS A MAYBE DATE, nointerest IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Contribution facts`
`contribution due` due `, paid` paid `, demand` demand `, no interest:` nointerest MEANS
    `Contribution facts` WITH
        `due on`                                            IS due
        `paid on`                                           IS paid
        `demand served on`                                  IS demand
        `the corporation resolved it bears no interest`     IS nointerest

GIVEN lots IS A NUMBER, sold IS A NUMBER, buyers IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Development facts`
`development of` lots `lots,` sold `sold to` buyers `purchasers` MEANS
    `Development facts` WITH
        `planning permission for strata subdivision after completion` IS TRUE
        `lots or proposed lots`                             IS lots
        `lots sold`                                         IS sold
        `purchasers`                                        IS buyers
        `first temporary occupation permit issued on`       IS NOTHING
        `the Division first applied on`                     IS NOTHING
        `has limited common property`                       IS FALSE

GIVEN accepted IS A BOOLEAN, shortlease IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A Disposal
`disposal, schedule accepted:` accepted `, lease of 21 years or less:` shortlease MEANS
    Disposal WITH
        `a schedule of strata units showing the share value accepted` IS accepted
        `a lease of 21 years or less without option to renew or purchase` IS shortlease
        `under a collective sale contract, before legal completion` IS FALSE

GIVEN sr IS A BOOLEAN, pub IS A MAYBE DATE, paid IS A BOOLEAN, action IS A BOOLEAN, asat IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Sale facts`
`sale facts, special resolution:` sr `, published` pub `, paid:` paid `, action pending:` action `, as at` asat MEANS
    `Sale facts` WITH
        `a special resolution to sell`                      IS sr
        `notice of sale published in an approved daily newspaper on` IS pub
        `paid in full after publication`                    IS paid
        `legal action pending to restrain the sale`         IS action
        `as at`                                             IS asat

GIVEN made IS A DATE, period IS A NUMBER, renewed IS A BOOLEAN, asat IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Interim order facts`
`interim order made` made `for` period `months, renewed:` renewed `, as at` asat MEANS
    `Interim order facts` WITH
        `made on`                                           IS made
        `period specified in months`                        IS period
        `renewal requested on`                              IS (IF renewed THEN JUST made ELSE NOTHING)
        `renewal decided`                                   IS renewed
        `renewed`                                           IS renewed
        `as at`                                             IS asat

